WEBVTT

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.610
Shall I call a taxi?

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:55.690
It's fine.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:08.160
You're very courageous.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:13.090
You're fighting the champion
in a match where anything goes.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.710
You're very courageous.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.970
Is he that strong?

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:23.300
If you exclude his father, Yujiro Hanma,

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.470
he's the strongest in the world.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:30.730
You're very courageous.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.730
<i>It's really happening tonight.</i>
<i>I'm doing it.</i>

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:39.740
I give you my full respect as a man.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.870
Allow me to show you the way.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.460
<i>Here,</i>

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.630
<i>six floors underground</i>

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>is where the arena is.</i>

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.970
<i>You can't hold a weapon,</i>
<i>but anything else is fair game.</i>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:04.300
<i>There are no rules to break,</i>
<i>and there's no referee.</i>

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.720
<i>There aren't even knockouts.</i>

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.650
<i>It's the ultimate fight to the end.</i>

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.160
Is something wrong?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.660
No.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:28.910
Let's go.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.540
We have a big audience tonight.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.920
They're here to see your courage.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.300
I shall come back to get you in an hour.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:44.930
Goodbye.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.440
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.980
<i>Do I think I'll win if I do this?</i>

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.730
<i>Do I have a chance at winning?</i>

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.410
<i>When I return to this hallway,</i>

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.910
<i>I'll be walking.</i>

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.590
<i>I'll come back walking.</i>

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.100
WHITE TIGER

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:28.930
<i>He's coming.</i>

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.850
<i>From the darkness on the other side.</i>

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.230
<i>A man stronger than them.</i>

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.610
<i>He's coming out to defeat me.</i>

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.040
<i>Yujiro Hanma?</i>

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.500
The Ogre?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.500
It's the Ogre!
The Strongest Creature on Earth!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:00.840
Why is he here?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.260
Does he want to fight?

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.380
Is he fighting with Alai Jr.?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.760
He wants to destroy him!

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.090
What do you want?

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.260
Finally...

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:13.350
Seems like you're grounded now.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:19.400
In the very near future,

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.780
he will bare his fangs at me.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:28.740
And, although he's an 18-year-old brat,

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.660
he's starting to grasp
the proper strength to do so.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.620
The opponent you're about to fight

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.750
is that kind of man.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:40.920
Stand aside.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.300
This is my spot.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.140
Fight to the death.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.060
And come after me.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:10.070
Move over!

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.250
Begin!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.960
<i>Go straight, as close as possible.</i>

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.090
<i>Be brave.</i>

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.090
<i>He's here within my range!</i>

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.430
<i>To the right. I missed!</i>

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.720
<i>So quick. He's coming!</i>

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.180
<i>I was hit. His right... Strong. Heavy.</i>

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:41.480
<i>The champion is so strong. I'm down.</i>

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.630
How was that? Do you want to keep going?

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:15.850
I messed up.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.060
That knockdown was your only chance.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.900
I've come to my senses thanks to you.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.400
I'm ready.

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.400
<i>A battle to the death.</i>

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.160
<i>Your friends taught me this.</i>

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:34.780
<i>Goki Shibukawa.</i>

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.290
<i>Doppo Orochi.</i>

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.620
<i>Jack Hammer.</i>

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:45.790
<i>The meaning behind struggles,</i>
<i>battles, and real fights.</i>

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.170
<i>I'm ready.</i>

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.680
I'll kill you before you kill me.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:57.180
<i>My father's high-level fighting method,</i>
<i>hit before getting hit.</i>

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:02.190
<i>I'll take it up a notch,</i>
<i>and now it's kill before getting killed.</i>

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.310
Even if I'm on death's door.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.690
<i>I'll kill you no matter...</i>

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.790
Here.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.750
You're on death's door.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.710
Hey, is that...

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.540
-Alai?
-No way!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.750
Mohammad Alai?

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.500
-Seriously?
-Is it really him?

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.760
-It's Alai!
-Mohammad Alai!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.510
Mohammad Alai is here!

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.010
Sorry.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:22.890
The legendary punch.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:24.770
I'm honored.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:26.230
And

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:30.020
if you didn't step in,
he would've been killed.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.820
With certainty.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.320
I knew, and that's why I jumped in.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:39.530
It's a serious offense,
but I don't regret it.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.040
Even if you kill me here.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.540
Kill without being killed.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.170
That's what Junior said to me.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.290
He tried to take his opponent's life

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.090
but wasn't willing to risk his.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.380
He tried to survive without being killed.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.090
Of course he'd be killed.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.430
He needs to be prepared for death,

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:05.980
like you when you jumped in.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:15.820
Old man.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.080
Fight me.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.080
That was my final defensive battle.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.670
I want to put an end to my story.

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.980
What's wrong? Now's your chance.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.990
Old man!

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.000
<i>Baki Hanma.</i>

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:15.380
<i>Was born as the son of Yujiro Hanma,</i>
<i>the Strongest Creature on Earth.</i>

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:21.340
<i>He's a man whose mother</i>
<i>was killed by Yujiro Hanma.</i>

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:30.770
<i>He is finally throwing</i>
<i>his father's challenge back in his face.</i>

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.660
Feeding on food, feeding on spirit,

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.790
feeding on joy,

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.160
feeding on sadness,

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.580
feeding on love,

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.340
feeding on scorn,

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.670
feeding on women's bodies...

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:00.970
Through many repetitions,

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:05.590
the insignificant, weak little kitten

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:10.020
has evolved into a lion
that can properly withstand my gaze.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.440
Striving for further transformation,

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.190
striving for further maturation...

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:21.190
<i>He deems him worthy.</i>

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.450
<i>The Ogre deems Baki worthy as an opponent.</i>

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:29.450
You're finally ready to be my prey.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.950
<i>What? Prey?</i>

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.710
<i>It's not a bluff.</i>

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.460
<i>He's saying such arrogant words</i>

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.960
<i>with overflowing self-esteem.</i>

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.090
Maybe you've grown old.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:44.930
I said I want to fight.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.220
Can't you hear?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:50.140
Your rash actions show how fresh you are.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.230
You've managed to age quite nicely.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.350
Eating you will be worth it.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.990
It seems you're following orders
and doing good work.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.740
Young lady.

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.660
Don't let him get bored.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.250
Mitsunari, I'll be waiting for details!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.720
You're so strong, Baki.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.060
You finished it in one hit.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.480
In just one hit...

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:41.320
He was a splendid fighter.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.190
So much that I couldn't finish it
in one blow.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.990
You can't talk like that.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.740
I'm sorry.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.830
Your next fight will be your last.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.750
I'm happy. I feel relieved.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.260
It's like any other father-son quarrel.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.260
It's nothing to brag about.

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.260
You have

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.770
become a great man.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.100
I'm going back alone.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.570
Aren't you

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.320
a fighter?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.750
I want to marry you.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.590
Aren't you...

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.270
SHIN SHIN KAI HQ

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.230
A loss is a loss.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.780
We were both clearly off the mark.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.660
He's gotten stronger.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.990
Yes, he has gotten stronger.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.500
Shibukawa.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.750
Could you beat Baki Hanma?

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:08.000
This has a strong smell,
but it's surprisingly good.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.630
It's snake alcohol.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:12.510
A friend from Okinawa gave it to me.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.510
Perhaps I could beat him.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:22.520
Baki's father, the Ogre,
accepted the fight.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:27.270
He said his son Baki
is a worthy challenger.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.190
I've made up my mind.

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:37.280
-What?
-There's no mistaking it.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.790
Yujiro Hanma accepted Baki's challenge.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:44.120
But the Ogre is a monster.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.670
No.

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.550
Baki Hanma has gotten stronger.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:55.090
He won instantly at the Raitai Tournament

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.220
and showed his overwhelming skill
in his fight with Alai Jr.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:02.810
He's no longer where he was before.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:08.190
It's a path walked by all fighters
and all martial artists.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:13.690
He's a step ahead towards the glory
of being the world's strongest man.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:18.200
What will you do, Katsumi?

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.710
-I see.
-Yes, sir.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:34.720
Hanayama, we could... For Baki.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.970
Leave him.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.220
It's proper manners.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.020
Yes, sir!

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:45.730
PRACTICAL MOTOBE-RYU JUJUTSU DOJO

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:50.980
Honestly, I'm too powerless
to go up against the Ogre.

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.490
Is it okay for me to say you're right?

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.490
Don't agree with me, idiot!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:18:00.160
Everyone is powerless
in front of the Ogre.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:01.580
It's true, but...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:07.290
Baki has gotten strong?

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.670
He's become strong.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.130
I see.

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:17.260
As men who have been defeated
by Baki before,

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.590
what should we do, Kureha?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.770
What did you say?

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:30.350
Baki Hanma challenged his father,
Yujiro Hanma.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:35.320
Yujiro, the head of Mitsunari Tokugawa's
underground fighting association,

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.530
accepted the challenge.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.030
He deemed the challenge worthy?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.040
That fool.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.050
So I have to think that he's worthy?

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.100
Hey, Baki.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.810
How long have we known each other?

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.810
-It's been a while.
-Yes.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.020
Yet there's one thing I find odd.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.320
Yes?

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.820
We've never had a match.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.070
Isn't that strange?

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:25.830
We're both aiming to be the strongest,

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:30.580
and we have never fought,
even though we could meet anytime.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.920
If I say that's true,

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.840
I feel like a kick will come flying at me.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:41.840
And?

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:43.340
Orochi.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:45.600
There's one thing

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.720
you're misunderstanding about me.

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:52.100
Is that so?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.650
The reason why I aim for
skill and strength

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.610
is different from you all.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.450
I don't want to be the strongest on Earth.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.870
<i>-That's what he said.</i>
<i>-Oh, boy.</i>

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:13.250
His father just happens to be
the strongest on Earth.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.460
He said that's it.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.720
That's quite an unfortunate thing.

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.850
If my father is
the weakest creature on Earth,

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.390
I'd be fine being the second weakest.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:33.440
Did that guy really say that?

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.900
Yes, apparently, he did.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.400
If that's true

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.900
he's definitely different from us.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:47.410
By the way,
what's he been doing down there?

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.040
He's not moving.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.920
He's probably

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.920
waiting for his thoughts to take shape.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.300
It's almost time.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.630
With willpower like his,

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:06.090
it should take about four to five minutes.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.430
-It's coming.
-Coming?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:12.680
Watch.

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.230
You'll see the level Baki is on.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.110
<i>It appeared out of nowhere.</i>

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.700
Amazing.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:33.160
<i>The fighters could clearly see it.</i>

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:38.210
<i>It was the visualized shape</i>
<i>of Baki's opponent.</i>

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:52.970
<i>United Republic of Tanzania</i>
<i>in East Africa.</i>

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.430
<i>Serengeti National Park.</i>

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:08.740
<i>The time difference with Japan</i>
<i>is six hours.</i>

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:15.160
<i>Here goes, old man!</i>

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:21.000
THE END

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:51.010
Subtitle translation by Chul Kim
